msgctxt "Description"
msgid ""
"[DEPRECATED: Prefer exchangerates_apilayer.com]. You can get the list of available quotes from <a href=\"https://exchangeratesapi.io/\">exchangeratesapi.io</a>.<br/>"
"<br/>"
"Then, you must create an account to get an API key and set it in setting.<br/>"
"Then, enter the expected quote in expected currency. Example: if you want BTC in USD, you must enter BTC-USD."
msgstr ""

